This implementation uses several Rust crates from third parties, including:
- axum (web framework)
- tokio (async runtime)
- tower (middleware)
- serde (serialization)
- tracing (logging)
- quick-xml (XML parsing)
- sha2/md5/hmac (cryptographic hashing)
- base64 (encoding)

